            "speaker_id": 315682,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Morning all. Following our product selection, I've drafted the accessory bundles in A1. The idea is to have a 'Good' and 'Best' option for each core product. Please take a look and share your feedback. This is for T3.",
