            "speaker_id": 106421,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks. The bundles in A1 look logical. For the OmniView TV 'Best' bundle, I'd suggest adding the premium wall mount, not just the high-speed HDMI cable and screen cleaner. It's a common add-on and a high-margin item.",
