            "text": "Concept 1 is a simple, single-color charcoal grey backdrop using a durable, slightly weighted fabric to ensure it hangs neatly. Concept 2 uses a dark blue with a subtle geometric pattern and is a lighter material. Both are fire-retardant and machine-washable. My recommendation is Concept 1 for a more premium, less distracting look.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 315682,
            "reply_to": "M57",
            "text": "This is fantastic, @448438. Thank you for the clear options and proactive safety considerations. I agree, the charcoal grey sounds very sleek and professional. It will make the screens pop. How will it be mounted?",
            "mentions": [
              448438
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
