          {
            "msg_id": "M59",
            "speaker_id": 448438,
            "reply_to": "M58",
            "text": "It will be mounted on a simple, lightweight frame that can be assembled on-site without any permanent fixtures, in line with the project constraints. The covers for smaller equipment will be simple fitted designs from the same material.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 106421,
            "reply_to": "M59",
            "text": "I also vote for Concept 1. The charcoal grey will look great with our store's aesthetic and won't show dust as easily. The simple frame is a good idea too.",
